# Lockfile is tracked on purpose: the repository guard requires a tracked
# lock for pinned production deps, and `uv sync --frozen` from a fresh
# checkout must reproduce this pin. Overrides the repo-root `uv.lock`/`*.lock`
# ignore for this package only.
!uv.lock
